      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 368.94601953125,
        "r": 290.83499999999987,
        "b": 360.8583344167462
      },
      "content": "Perform a Class 1 test in accordance with tester instructions."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0643",
      "reading_order": 823,
      "section": "Earth/insulation test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.01799999999997,
        "t": 357.06601953125,
        "r": 346.518,
        "b": 348.61833441674617
      },
      "content": " A PASS indicates the oven earthing circuit is functioning correctly."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0644",
      "reading_order": 824,
      "section": "Earth/insulation test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.01799999999997,
        "t": 345.06901953125,
        "r": 559.2690000000001,
        "b": 324.2643344167461
      },
      "content": " If  a  FAIL  is  indicated  (i.e.,  unit  exceeds maximum  limit), remove the casing  of the  appliance  and check ALL earth connections. Then repeat the Class 1 test."
    },
